{"type":"Feature","id":"43BCCF2E9370DC40","properties":{"layer":"Suburb Hoods","name":"Fairview-TheHill ⛰️-🔱💙✡️-☪️⭐🎩","description":"Northside\n\nLocation: Englewood to Briggs/Fernwood & Rosalind to Woodruff\n\nCity: Joliet, J-Town\n\nGangs: Gangster Disciples & Conservative Vice Lords\n\nThe Hill was & is the most notorious hood in Joliet. Still to this day, many Joliet residents fear The Hill & would would never come up here. When I was a kid from the Eastside we were told to never go up The Hill even though where we lived was dangerous, everyone knew The Hill was a different world. The Poole Gardens Homes were torn down in the mid 2000s but the Fairview Homes didn't come down till 2019 & truth be told, its much quieter on these streets than what I remember in my teen years, The Hill was fucking crazy. Its still one if the worst hoods in Jtown lol but the projects is all gone & so is a lot of the crime. \n\nIn a strange, fucked up kind of way that I'm not sure how to explain, it's sad to not see these Projects of Joliet anymore.\n","gang":"Gangster Disciples"},"geometry":{"type":"Polygon","coordinates":[[[-88.0634106,41.5533142],[-88.0628963,41.548329],[-88.0605418,41.5462714],[-88.0601732,41.5435171],[-88.0568518,41.5406269],[-88.0437788,41.5461239],[-88.0441071,41.5537065],[-88.0559442,41.553419],[-88.0634106,41.5533142]]]}}
